# DeepL API Configuration
#
# OPTIONAL (bring-your-own-key model). The shared demo key was disabled due
# to abuse, so visitors normally supply their own DeepL API key per request
# via the X-DeepL-Key header. That key is used only to process the request
# and is never stored or logged.
#
# If you set DEEPL_API_KEY here it is used ONLY as a fallback when a request
# does not provide its own key. Leave it unset to require per-request keys.
# Get a key at: https://www.deepl.com/pro-api  (free keys end in :fx)
# DEEPL_API_KEY=your_deepl_api_key_here
